# Proxies trusted for the client IP (per-IP rate limits). Default (unset): one proxy on localhost
# or a private network, e.g. nginx/Vite in Docker. Behind a CDN, list its addresses or a hop
# count (e.g. 2). Never "true": clients could then fake their IP with X-Forwarded-For.
# TRUST_PROXY=

